{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1755302400, "end_date": 1755993599, "month_true_total": 41, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:16:22 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "202615313", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163450287", "personaname": "クリスティアン", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198163450287/", "num_games_owned": 97, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1700, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1292, "last_played": 1785376014, "avatar": "18cf9e93edbe79213f24fd277a0c8fc05e9ec68f"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "esta en algo", "timestamp_created": 1755819307, "timestamp_updated": 1755819307, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202561963", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055839605", "personaname": "Pessic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055839605/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 466, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 466, "last_played": 1755613560, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "No he acabado la campaña, no da miedo, pero es entretenido. Mejor jugar con amigos. La configuración por cartas y suministros se me hace un poco liado.", "timestamp_created": 1755748888, "timestamp_updated": 1755748888, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202530355", "author": {"steamid": "76561199157305132", "personaname": "Bastikkk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199157305132/", "num_games_owned": 453, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 3962, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3867, "last_played": 1777856558, "avatar": "7dfe1512ea1c7de28c2df1e5f4ea0f6bcf1693e5"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "En su momento a la gente no le gusto porque esperaban un left 4 dead, pero lo unico que tiene de left 4 dead es que es un juego de zombies, fuera de eso es como comparar peras con manzanas, juegazo 100/10", "timestamp_created": 1755707432, "timestamp_updated": 1755707432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202496535", "author": {"steamid": "76561199048322397", "personaname": "Derî", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Derderin/", "num_games_owned": 201, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 670, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 336, "last_played": 1779668527, "avatar": "b3877044cdfff2ddb4288f670e0656064d9f1b2d"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Eres fanático de L4D?\r\nEs tu juego, un L4D con esteroides, las dificultades bajas son lo ideal para disfrutar de la historia o de da runos cuantos tiros al día, las altas de verdad ponen a prueba que tan bueno eres al apuntar y reaccionar, si tienes amigos (No es mi caso), parece ser mucho mas divertido", "timestamp_created": 1755662153, "timestamp_updated": 1755662153, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202484544", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053563390", "personaname": "Northland", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053563390/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 147, "playtime_forever": 157, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 157, "last_played": 1663586167, "avatar": "83283775c0f569a88dfba24c603296da00bde192"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es un juego entretenido que consigue enganchar gracias a su acción frenética y su ambientación apocalíptica. Sin embargo, el enfoque cooperativo puede llegar a ser un obstáculo para disfrutarlo al máximo: una vez que pasa el boom inicial y la mayoría de jugadores migran a otros títulos, encontrar compañeros para jugar se vuelve complicado. \n\nPor otro lado, la inteligencia artificial que controla a los personajes cuando juegas en solitario deja bastante que desear; en ocasiones, casi preferirías enfrentarte a la horda tú solo. En definitiva, Back 4 Blood es divertido, pero depende demasiado de jugar en grupo para sacarle todo el partido.", "timestamp_created": 1755644521, "timestamp_updated": 1755644521, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}